     "type": "text-editor",
     "id": "3935494b",
     "text": "Mango It’s an oval shaped fruit that is from the cashew family, it has many varieties That ranges in the level of sweetness and their buttery flesh. Mango sizes vary from 5 to 15 cm in length and from 4 to 10 cm in width and weights from 150 grams to 750 grams per fruit. Some of the most popular mango varieties are; Keitt, Kent, Naomi, and Tommy Atkins",
     "html": "<h3><span><b>Mango</b><br/></span></h3><h3><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-weight: 400;\"><span> It’s an oval shaped fruit that is from the cashew family, it has many varieties That ranges in the level of sweetness and their buttery flesh. Mango sizes vary from 5 to 15 cm in length and from 4 to 10 cm in width and weights from 150 grams to 750 grams per fruit. Some of the most popular mango varieties are; Keitt, Kent, Naomi, and Tommy Atkins<br/></span></span></h3>"
    },
